0.6 w 54.00 747.00 m 558.00 747.00 l S
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Step: 4) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (Title: Pre-screen against RTA and submit when the data lands) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (Action: Complete the RTA checklist inside the file, pay fees a few days early, and submit as soon as the final) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (test report arrives.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (Detail: Rob's rule is 'Just go ahead and submit it when you have the data,' with a completed RTA checklist in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (Section 1 or Section 21 [MedicalMarcom - gGje01O9B44 @ 00:13:09].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (The money map starts with the FDA user fee, and the numbers move with the year each practitioner quoted.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (In the Joe Hage session Packard cites $10,953 standard and $2,738 for small business, and lays out the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (testing bill that dwarfs it: about $13,000 for biocompatibility, $40k at the low end and $50-60k typical for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (electrical safety and EMC, tens of thousands for orthopedic cyclic testing, $100,000-plus for animal studies,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (and up to $3M for a 500-600 patient clinical, with $1M-plus as the ballpark [-ceDuiClggg @ 00:10:04]. Qualio) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (puts the 2023 standard fee at almost $20,000 and the small-business fee at about $5,000 for firms under) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm ($100M, requiring Form 3602/3602A plus a tax return, two to six weeks to process, and yearly renewal;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (wholly owned subsidiaries must demonstrate independence to claim the discount [1GKnWm8UYVk @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (00:37:33]. In a second Joe Hage session Rob quotes consultant fees from $10K to $150K, with most landing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (between $20K and $25K, and prices the job out loud: about 100 hours at $250 an hour is 25 grand) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm ([gGje01O9B44 @ 01:20:17]. Pre-sub prep runs about 10 hours, roughly $2,500, and Packard says pre-sub) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (feedback, while non-binding, saves $10k-plus [-ceDuiClggg @ 01:20:57].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (The review clock is the second set of numbers every operator has to run. The Part II workshop lays it out by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (day: receipt by day 7, acceptance or RTA by day 15 with a refusal resetting the clock to day 0, substantive) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (review ending in an additional-information hold or interactive review by day 60, and a decision by day 90) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm ([nUaPO0mfwKI @ 00:29:17]. Rob's realistic total is 120 to 130 days, with interactive review running about) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (30 days to decision and the e-copy accepted and assigned a K number within 24 to 48 hours once fees are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (paid a few days early [gGje01O9B44 @ 00:11:34]. The highest-leverage trick on this clock is annotating the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (RTA checklist with the exact location of every item; the workshop speaker once got acceptance on day 2) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (doing it, and Rob, who includes a completed checklist in Section 1 or Section 21, reports the last two) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (consultant-led files passed RTA on the first try [nUaPO0mfwKI @ 00:31:54]. When RTA does bounce a file,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (Packard's move is to phone the reviewer before resubmitting, since RTA can reject the same submission) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (multiple times [-ceDuiClggg @ 00:27:35]. Once a hold letter lands, there are 180 days to answer, only one) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (hold allowed, and an extension available.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (The build order is fixed across the MedicalMarcom sessions. Performance testing goes first, then Section 4) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (indications for use, then device description, substantial equivalence, the 510\(k\) summary, and the executive) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.80 Tm (summary dead last; 'Write it last,' as the workshop puts it [yIARvVKN5-s @ 00:20:07]. Rob names the five) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (critical sections as 4, 5, 10, 11, and 12, and the workshop treats sections 1, 3, and 6 as boilerplate while) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 191.35 Tm (marketing owns labeling and the IFU early. Predicate research runs through FDA's own databases.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.12 Tm (Searching product code OSH returned 3 predicates in the classification database but 90 in the 510\(k\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 160.90 Tm (database, and a company holding a 510\(k\) statement must supply a redacted copy within 30 days of request) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 145.67 Tm ([gGje01O9B44 @ 00:20:07]. Qualio's search for pregnancy tests turned up 316 predicates and points) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 130.45 Tm (operators to K-number summaries, the three-letter product code, MAUDE, IFUs, and FOIA requests that can) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 115.22 Tm (take years [1GKnWm8UYVk @ 00:15:11]. Packard calls the TPLC database, with recent 510\(k\)s, recalls, a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 100.00 Tm (Pareto by failure mode, and MDR links, 'Tens of thousands of dollars worth of consulting' [yIARvVKN5-s @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 84.77 Tm (00:07:13]. Registration & Listing confirms the predicate is legally marketed. Keyword discipline matters too:) Tj ET
