BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 669.77 Tm (The most expensive mistake the FDA veterans describe is timing, and the second is disguise. Phillips says a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 654.55 Tm (late 806 report invites a 483 or a warning letter scaled to how late it was, and a firm that hoped nobody) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.32 Tm (would notice is still exposed when an investigator finds it months later [aYQu_0ujhyU @ 00:22:33]. They) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.10 Tm (also flag the camouflage moves FDA sees through: a recall dressed up as a technical bulletin, or a quiet) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 608.87 Tm (recall [aYQu_0ujhyU @ 00:34:48]. Needelman draws the silent-recall line with a bulb hypothetical: lamps) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 593.65 Tm (failing at 22 to 23 months are not a recall, lamps failing at 8 to 9 months are, and a depleted backup battery) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.42 Tm (is a recall too; they cite a Medrad warning letter as the live example [nJblY5CRIVY @ 00:51:13]. Their fix for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.20 Tm (the clock is blunt: 80% of the information on time beats 100% late, amend later, and promptly reporting in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 547.97 Tm (those 10 days is critical [nJblY5CRIVY @ 00:52:35]. The trap on the other side is an 806 report stuffed with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 532.75 Tm (placeholder entries, which they say has no value at all. Phillips adds that vague recall letters raise red flags,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 517.52 Tm (and that asking FDA what you should do is not a plan.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.30 Tm (MAUDE punishes anyone who reads it at face value. The Health Watch USA pharmacology researcher ran) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.07 Tm (roughly 7.5 million events from 1997 to 2018 through custom software and found manufacturers filed 96.6%) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 471.85 Tm (of reports, possibly driven by warranty claims and lawsuits, while physicians filed directly only 0.49% and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 456.62 Tm (facilities 1.3% despite mandatory reporting [yKomHc_DWtw @ 00:05:20]. The same study hit Johnson &) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.40 Tm (Johnson logged under multiple name variants, common duplicates, and a cobalt toxicity pull of 14,714) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.17 Tm (records where only 4% listed lab levels [yKomHc_DWtw @ 00:07:05]. Smart warns that narratives can be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 410.95 Tm (empty and get filled in later, that reports arrive late and underreported, and that FDA itself says MAUDE) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 395.72 Tm (cannot assess prevalence [a-scTl1C2PA @ 00:09:23]. Bernstein adds that clinical sites and manufacturers) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 380.50 Tm (each file narratives on the same problem, very ill patients confound causation, and a record is not causation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.27 Tm (until it is cross-checked against manufacturer claims, patient records and FDA findings [xbxXTRwdVRs @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.05 Tm (00:30:15]. Alawad's zero-result fix is to widen dates, drop brand and event type, and try every manufacturer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 334.82 Tm (name variant, as with Rosh versus Rocher. Gene Parunak still calls a cursory keyword look at similar) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 319.60 Tm (devices well worth your time.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.37 Tm (The economics bite hardest where records and contracts are thin. Pudwell calls a recall without distribution) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 289.15 Tm (records a rough spot, wants both ship-to and bill-to consignees notified, and warns that indiscriminate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 273.92 Tm (notices desensitize customers [sNeRd4nIrG8 @ 00:10:55]. Needelman closes two escape hatches: if one) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 258.70 Tm (unit of a 100-unit lot ships, the action is no longer a stock recovery, and an expired warranty is no excuse,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 243.47 Tm (so set an end-of-life date and resist that temptation [nJblY5CRIVY @ 00:14:26]. They also describe recall) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 228.25 Tm (fatigue, the same device recalled for 6 to 12 reasons inside 6 to 9 months, and push sales staff into the field) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 213.02 Tm (for visits. David Graham, the 35-year litigator, says an opaque recall turns a bad device case into a bad) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 197.80 Tm (company case, so assume every document goes public and line up a communication plan or PR firm,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 182.57 Tm (supply-chain indemnification and cost analysis, contracts and recall insurance [aYQu_0ujhyU @ 00:45:18].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 167.35 Tm (The early-warning cost is real: Alawad found Ethicon stapler reports sitting in MAUDE 2 years before a recall) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 152.12 Tm (that covered 92,000 US devices [a_T4LqfP6zE @ 00:43:24]. Usually, as Alawad puts it, you're not the only) Tj ET
