BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 512.30 Tm (companies, which is why their own two-day class went through BLS accreditation [kBlmK6r6MgU @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 497.07 Tm (00:47:38]. The opposite playbook comes from the Laser Safety Certification portal, which sells fully online) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 481.85 Tm (courses where staff get 'certified in about an hour,' print the certificate instantly, and are pitched as 100%) Tj ET
