BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 436.17 Tm (sufficient' to put YAG capsulotomy and SLT into optometry offices as in-office procedures [3pHyNlFBLO0 @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 420.95 Tm (00:02:12]. For an operator staffing a laser service line, a one-hour printed certificate, a two-day) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 405.72 Tm (BLS-approved course and a 32-hour clinical course are three very different pieces of paper, and only the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 390.50 Tm (BLS-approved route feeds the CLSO or CMLSO application after a year of hands-on LSO duty.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 375.27 Tm (On the treatment floor, the disagreements are about wavelength, cooling and speed. Dr. Azi of Skin By Dr.) Tj ET
