BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 344.82 Tm (most uncomfortable and the slowest, while the 1064 nm YAG is the safer pick for darker skin because it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 329.60 Tm (bypasses surface melanin and goes more directly to the hair root [lY2Cys5Df0c @ 00:02:57]. The same) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 314.37 Tm (dermatologist goes the other way for heavy growth, telling patients, particularly men, to start on IPL or BBL) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 299.15 Tm (to cut hair density at roughly half the treatment time, then switch to the more potent laser [lY2Cys5Df0c @) Tj ET
