BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (The most expensive trap is assuming whoever brought the laser owns the safety program. Patty Owens is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (blunt that rental and leasing companies sending technicians 'are not your LSO and they do not provide you a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (laser safety program,' and if that company takes case data back to bill the hospital, the facility is releasing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (PHI and needs either patient consent or a signed business associate agreement [4yS9pDHEcIs @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (00:36:30]. Dennis hears the same excuse constantly, 'the rental company is our LSO,' and answers that it is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (your patient in your institution, so the responsibility stays with you [kBlmK6r6MgU @ 00:07:38]. Hardware) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (that changes hands carries its own landmine: Dennis describes an older laser whose interlock code was) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (5678, a code 'everybody in the United States had,' so the code had to be changed to keep anybody and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (everybody from accessing it [4yS9pDHEcIs @ 00:19:37]. Owens adds that CMS-driven accreditors expect a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (detailed inventory of every laser, leased, rented, borrowed or purchased, listing wavelength, classification,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (manufacturer, location, purchase date, maintenance and service records, usually held with biomed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm ([4yS9pDHEcIs @ 00:33:02]. A unit that arrives without that paper trail drops straight into a survey gap with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (Joint Commission, Quad A or DNV surveyors.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (Biomed-level failures show up when clinical staff improvise. Dennis recalls a last job where staff assumed an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (excimer laser for cardiac procedures could simply be rolled downstairs to the cath lab; it needed a 50 amp) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (plug the room did not have, and Dennis had to pull the biomed in to stop it [kBlmK6r6MgU @ 00:17:08]. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (same talk flags nurses and techs jerking plugs from the wall and reaching for extension or cheater cords on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (powerful lasers, plus a biomed colleague pointing out that taking the skin off a small holmium unit lets the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (average power be changed from 15 to 30 watts, which Dennis flatly refused to do [kBlmK6r6MgU @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (00:15:38]. Skipping paperwork is the quieter failure. 'Nobody got hurt' is the excuse Dennis hears for not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (filing variance reports, yet that tracking is exactly how a facility learns a brand of fiber keeps breaking and is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (really a limited-life product [4yS9pDHEcIs @ 00:21:55]. Eyewear purchasing trips people up too: in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (TechNation poll, 25% of attendees picked eyewear labeled 'laser approved' over glasses marked with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (optical density and wavelength, the only answer Owens accepts under OSHA and ANSI [kBlmK6r6MgU @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (00:42:50]. Eyewear also has to be dedicated to the specific laser, stored and cleaned properly, and audited) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (for condition.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.15 Tm (Patient-side and licensing failures hit revenue directly. Dr. Azi warns that plucking or pulling hairs within six) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.92 Tm (weeks of a hair removal appointment strips the melanin target so the laser 'will not work,' while hair left on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 289.70 Tm (the surface absorbs energy, chars and leaves a burnt-hair smell; an active tan or IPL on very dark skin) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 274.47 Tm (raises burn risk [lY2Cys5Df0c @ 00:06:58]. Laser Queen MD cautions that the GentleMax Pro 1064 nm skin) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 259.25 Tm (tightening service is not designed to remove pigmentation, post-acne dark spots or acne scars, needs three) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 244.02 Tm (to four sessions about four weeks apart, and is wrong for keloid-prone clients [NarF87OCldw @ 00:00:37].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 228.80 Tm (Licensing timelines are the cash-flow trap. In Queensland, K-Laser Australia says a doctor's user license) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 213.57 Tm (averages 5 to 8 weeks, and a clinic without a laser then needs a possession license taking about 2 to 3) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 198.35 Tm (months plus a clinic-specific radiation safety protection plan before an approval to acquire lets the unit be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 183.12 Tm (delivered [Hsmu9JQR5UM @ 00:04:36]. Credentials can stall too: NCLC requires a 70 to pass, a 30-day) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 167.90 Tm (gap before any retest, and renewal every three years with 24 continuing education hours [KPlnFyWRwTQ @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 152.67 Tm (00:06:35]. Low-level therapy has its own dosing trap, since BioFlex teaches that too high a dose actually) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 137.45 Tm (inhibits the effect.) Tj ET
