BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 317.77 Tm (Flexible endoscopes are the costliest failure point here, and Joe, clinical operations manager at Surgical) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 302.55 Tm (Direct, maps exactly where they break. Letting the scope hit a hard floor can damage any portion of it, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 287.32 Tm (the soft bending rubber at the tip is easily cut by a sharp instrument or an animal's tooth [DrTCjk0roNk @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 272.10 Tm (00:01:20]. Joe calls leak testing the most important part of scope care: lock the leak tester onto the soaking) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 256.87 Tm (cap, pump until the gauge sits in the test area, confirm it does not drop for a few seconds, then submerge,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 241.65 Tm (because catching a leak early is the difference between a complete rebuild and a small bending rubber) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 226.42 Tm (repair [DrTCjk0roNk @ 00:06:24]. Sequencing errors fake the result. Adding enzymatic cleaner before the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 211.20 Tm (leak test fills the water with bubbles and produces a false positive, and failing to flush every channel of air) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 195.97 Tm (does the same; genuine leaks usually look like champagne bubbles [DrTCjk0roNk @ 00:08:18]. MFI Medical) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 180.75 Tm (applies the same leak discipline to anesthesia equipment, listing leak checks, proper calibration, and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 165.52 Tm (manufacturer's upkeep guidelines as the baseline for safe operation [jzPWxnzAds0 @ 00:01:40]. Any scope) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 150.30 Tm (or anesthesia unit moving through resale lives or dies on these checks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 135.07 Tm (Sterile-processing mistakes show up as scrapped packs, rusted steel, torn pouches, and retained gauze.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 119.85 Tm (Romo at Texas A&M wears a bouffant while washing, packing, and wrapping because a hair found in a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 104.62 Tm (pack, whether anyone calls it sterile hair or not, means passing that pack off and pulling a new one) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 89.40 Tm ([WoO-cNElJpg @ 00:10:54]. Mages warns that instruments left in the ultrasonic cleaner or the milk bath) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 74.17 Tm (overnight will rust, so the cycle has to be finished by whoever started it rather than left for somebody else) Tj ET
